The popup glassmorphism is already in the CSS. Lines 334 and 505 in `public/styles.css` target `.leaflet-popup-content-wrapper` with glass styles. Line 736 handles the fare widget inside popups. Let me verify the popup content gets glassmorphism by checking the CSS rules around those lines:
